WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.166
- This can't happen again, Rob. Trade Russ, maybe a pick, and we get Kuzma and KCP.

00:00:05.166 --> 00:00:10.125
What? Yeah, I—Duh, Rob, I know. Make the trade, Roooob!

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:14.125
The arena outside of space and time.

00:00:14.125 --> 00:00:17.916
- Welcome, The King, LeBron James...

00:00:17.916 --> 00:00:20.375
- Finally. Me and him.

00:00:20.375 --> 00:00:22.125
I can't wait to compare Space Jams.

00:00:22.541 --> 00:00:25.250
- ...to our first two-on-two Portal matchup.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:28.250
- Woah, woah, woah, woah, woah. Two-on-two? But KD got his own—

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:31.541
Oh, yes. I like this. Because I am a good teammate.

00:00:31.541 --> 00:00:34.166
- [Old-school announcer:] Versus Shaquille O'Neal.

00:00:34.166 --> 00:00:37.000
- And me! NBA All-Star Penny Hardaway!

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.125
- All right. Let's destroy this old man.

00:00:39.125 --> 00:00:41.041
- Whatever, man, at least I get to play with—

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:44.375
- [Modern announcer:] Joining LeBron is 
Anthonyyyy Davis!

00:00:44.375 --> 00:00:47.000
- Hey, LeBron! It's me, AD!

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.833
- Oh, come on. He's not even my best sidekick.

00:00:50.375 --> 00:00:52.500
- Ha, Penny's not Shaq's best either.

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:54.750
- What? I'm no sidekick.

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:58.583
- [Modern announcer:] Y'all know the deal: 
play to 11, win by two.

00:00:58.583 --> 00:00:59.625
- I'll check Penny.

00:00:59.625 --> 00:01:03.083
- Man, if you don't get your lanky ass down in the paint and guard Shaq.

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:05.875
- Barbecue chicken.

00:01:08.125 --> 00:01:10.541
- [Old-school announcer:] Shaq hammers it home with authority.

00:01:10.541 --> 00:01:11.875
- Damn, did that hurt?

00:01:11.875 --> 00:01:14.375
Use Portal Cream, the only interdimensional ointment–

00:01:14.375 --> 00:01:17.041
- [Modern announcer:] Shaq wasting no time hawking products.

00:01:23.708 --> 00:01:25.833
- [Old-school announcer:] Shaq sent that flying into the next dimension!

00:01:25.833 --> 00:01:26.500
- [Fan:] Damn!

00:01:27.375 --> 00:01:28.166
- All me!

00:01:28.375 --> 00:01:31.500
- [Modern announcer:] Shaq with the filthy handles!

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:36.375
- Hey, I need you to step your game up.
My legacy can't afford a Portal loss.

00:01:36.375 --> 00:01:37.458
- Help, help!

00:01:37.458 --> 00:01:38.083
- Aaah!

00:01:38.083 --> 00:01:39.375
- [Modern announcer:] AD with the help D.

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.666
- You see that, LeBron? I did good, right?

00:01:45.041 --> 00:01:45.666
[Shaq chuckles]

00:01:47.625 --> 00:01:50.708
- Taxes complicated because you 
sometimes work in space?

00:01:50.708 --> 00:01:53.625
Try ShaqTax! Isn't that right, Lil' Penny?

00:01:53.625 --> 00:01:55.500
- Man, I am regular Penny.

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:57.375
The puppet isn't 6’ f--kin' 7”!

00:01:57.375 --> 00:01:59.541
- Look, I don't want us ending up like those two.

00:01:59.541 --> 00:02:01.750
- If we cool, why'd you go to Disney World 
without me?

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:03.500
- Because you can't fit on the rides!

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:05.875
- So if you don't want to play as a big man, that's fine.

00:02:05.875 --> 00:02:10.750
Just be yourself. As long as it means 
me getting a win.

00:02:10.750 --> 00:02:14.375
- You might be Superman in the paint,
but you're Kazaam on the perimeter.

00:02:21.625 --> 00:02:25.916
- You know, Shaquille, at times like this, I worry about
the 1990's Orlando Magic dynasty.

00:02:28.375 --> 00:02:28.791
Thanks.

00:02:31.666 --> 00:02:34.125
- [Old-school announcer:] Oh! Shaq 
with the follow slam!

00:02:34.125 --> 00:02:35.750
- [Modern announcer:] That bucket puts them back within one.

00:02:36.625 --> 00:02:37.708
- I'm open!

00:02:37.708 --> 00:02:39.750
- I'm Shaq. Ah!

00:02:40.875 --> 00:02:42.625
- [Old-school announcer:] And now, game point!

00:02:42.625 --> 00:02:43.291
- AD!

00:02:43.916 --> 00:02:48.000
- [Modern announcer:] LeBron and AD pull off an improbable win!

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:51.041
- Must be nice in L.A. Tons of media opportunities.

00:02:51.041 --> 00:02:53.166
- I have one eyebrow and I keep getting offers.

00:02:53.166 --> 00:02:54.833
- Later, Penny. I'm going with them.

00:02:54.833 --> 00:02:56.166
- Shaq, you son of a b---h.

00:02:56.875 --> 00:02:59.291
- Wow, I am a team player.

